# The build context of mobile/web.Dockerfile is the repository root, so only what the web export
# needs goes in (Docker reads this file because it sits next to the Dockerfile, with the same name).
# Never an .env file: the page calls no API, and a value baked in would ship to every visitor.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!patches
!packages
!mobile
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
mobile/dist
mobile/.expo
mobile/ios
mobile/android
